      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are thrilled to bring to the market this superb A Rated 4 bedroom, 4 bathroom family home located on Kilcarbery Grange, Clondalkin. This peaceful development is home to many growing families and boasts close proximity to Clondalkin Village, placing all essential amenities right on your doorstep such as bars, shops, local schools, sporting facilities and Corkagh park. Liffey Valley Shopping Centre is just a short drive away and the N7/M50 road networks and local bus/ train links make commuting and access to the City Centre easy.\n\nBright and spacious living accommodation of c.160 sq. m briefly comprises of entrance hallway, living room, guest W.C, open-plan kitchen/diner and utility room. To the rear, there is an extra large sunny, low maintenance garden. The first floor hosts three spacious bedrooms, one of which with ensuite along with the main family bathroom. The second floor hosts another large bedroom with ensuite and ample storage space.\n\nNo. 41 was built in 2021 and comes to the market in Turn Key condition throughout. Further benefits include an A Ber rating, ample storage space, parking, sunny rear garden and stylish upgrades throughout.\n\nBased on the pristine condition of this property, we know this will be very popular so contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers at your earliest convenience to register your interest or to arrange a viewing.\n\nFeatures;\n- 4 BED / 4 BATH\n- c. 160 sq.m\n- A2 BER rating\n- Within new build home warranty\n- Sunny rear garden\n- Pristine condition from top to bottom\n- Flooded with natural light\n- Easy access to Corkagh Park\n- Parking available\n- Lots of built in storage space\n- All essential amenities in close proximity\n- Fonthill train station within easy reach\n- N7/M50 within minutes\n- Ideal for first time buyers, growing families and investors\n- Viewing highly advised!\n\n\nDirections:\n\nD22 F2R0"
      },
      {
